  `lcE_eval`, `lcE_bnd` (all partial sums of `n ≤ 2^e` terms of size `≤ w` have size `≤ w + e`).
* `FSp.mvN`: the fine counted move with the count read from a register and its loop overhead
  bounded by the count itself (`≤ N (250 w + 1600) + 2000`, no `Bb`).
