* `getD_pairL`: index semantics.
* `Enc W L e zs y`: `zs` encodes the role streams `y w p` (`w < W`, `p < L`) with per-role scale
  `2^{-e w}`: `toC zs[w L + p] = 2^{e w} y w p`.
